# eslint-plugin-vue@8 is required (`.eslintrc.js` uses the `vue/setup-compiler-macros`
# env, added in v8). But @vue/eslint-config-standard@6.1.0 peers `eslint-plugin-vue@^7`,
# so npm 7+ aborts with ERESOLVE. The two cannot be satisfied together without
# upgrading the whole lint chain (eslint 8 + @vue/eslint-config-standard 7).
# Tracked in: dependency upgrade follow-up.
legacy-peer-deps=true
